{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"recent-files","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Recent Files","description":"A sidebar list of the files you opened lately, newest first, remembered for each project.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.1"},"categories":["Productivity"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","main":"extension.js","activationEvents":["onStartup"],"permissions":["workspace.read"],"contributes":{"commands":[{"command":"recentFiles.clear","title":"Clear Recent Files","category":"Recent Files"},{"command":"recentFiles.open","title":"Recent Files (internal)","category":"Recent Files","hidden":true}],"viewsContainers":[{"id":"recent","title":"Recent Files","icon":"history"}],"views":[{"id":"recentFiles.list","name":"Recent","container":"recent","type":"tree"}],"configuration":{"title":"Recent Files","properties":{"recentFiles.max":{"type":"number","default":30,"description":"How many files to remember for each project."}}}}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"extension.js":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"// Recent Files: a sidebar list of the files you opened lately, newest first. It remembers them between sessions.\n\nconst KEY = 'recent.v1';\n\n/** Puts a file first, removes duplicates and keeps `max` entries. */\nfunction remember(list, entry, max) {\n  return [entry, ...list.filter((x) => x.path !== entry.path)].slice(0, max);\n}\n\nfunction ago(ms, now = Date.now()) {\n  const s = Math.max(0, Math.round((now - ms) / 1000));\n  if (s < 60) return 'just now';\n  if (s < 3600) return Math.floor(s / 60) + ' min ago';\n  if (s < 86400) return Math.floor(s / 3600) + ' h ago';\n  return Math.floor(s / 86400) + ' d ago';\n}\n\nfunction relative(path, root) {\n  const p = String(path).replace(/\\\\/g, '/');\n  const r = String(root || '').replace(/\\\\/g, '/').replace(/\\/+$/, '');\n  return r && p.toLowerCase().startsWith(r.toLowerCase() + '/') ? p.slice(r.length + 1) : p;\n}\n\nexports._test = { remember, ago, relative };\n\nexports.activate = function (context) {\n  const max = () => Math.max(5, Math.min(100, Number(ferrum.settings.get('recentFiles.max')) || 30));\n  const read = async () => (await ferrum.storage.get(KEY, {}))[ferrum.workspace.root || ''] || [];\n  const write = async (list) => {\n    const all = await ferrum.storage.get(KEY, {});\n    all[ferrum.workspace.root || ''] = list;\n    await ferrum.storage.set(KEY, all);\n  };\n\n  const view = ferrum.window.registerTreeView('recentFiles.list', {\n    getChildren: async (element) => {\n      if (element) return [];\n      const list = await read();\n      return list.map((f) => ({ id: f.path, label: f.name, description: relative(f.path, ferrum.workspace.root).replace(/[^/]*$/, '').replace(/\\/$/, '') + (f.at ? '  ' + ago(f.at) : ''), icon: 'file', tooltip: f.path, command: 'recentFiles.open', args: [f.path] }));\n    },\n  });\n\n  context.subscriptions.push(\n    view,\n    ferrum.events.on('open', async (info) => {\n      if (!info || !info.path) return;\n      await write(remember(await read(), { path: info.path, name: info.name, at: Date.now() }, max()));\n      view.refresh();\n    }),\n    ferrum.commands.register('recentFiles.open', async (path) => {\n      if (path) await ferrum.editor.openFile(String(path));\n    }),\n    ferrum.commands.register('recentFiles.clear', async () => {\n      await write([]);\n      view.refresh();\n    }),\n  );\n};\n\nexports.deactivate = function () {};\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Recent Files\n\nA **Recent Files** icon in the activity bar lists the files you opened, newest first, with how long ago. Click one to open it again. The list is kept for each project and stays between sessions.\n\n## Permissions\n**workspace.read**, to open a file when you click it.\n"}}}